@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Developers
	Frontend testing for the www developers

Scenario: Developers Homepage Navigation
	End users should be able to view all links in the developers homepage.

	Given I go to the www page with the url "developers"
	Then there should be no errors on the page
    When I click on the "Community Site" card on the developers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
	When I go to the www page with the url "developers"
    And I click on the "Documentation" card on the developers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "developers"
    And I click on the "Community Downloads" card on the developers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "developers"
    And I click on the "Marketplace" card on the developers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"
    When I go to the www page with the url "developers"
    And I click on the "Customer Portal" card on the developers homepage
    Then there should be no errors on the page
	And the current url content should not contain the text "www-uat.liferay.com"